        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Become the Tactical Commander and experience a brand-new Auto Chess gameplay that blends character evolution, team composition, and real-time spells! Every match is a collision of strategy and luck, and every battle lets you experience the ever-changing charm of strategy!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Core Features</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>[Character Evolution]</strong> — Synthesize and evolve to create an unstoppable army!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect identical characters and synthesize them to break their limits! Evolve from ordinary warriors into legendary gods of war, with both appearance and strength transforming in sync.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combine the right character skills for synergy, and create the strongest team with multiple skill combinations!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose heroes with the right body types for both mass tactics and heroism!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>[Strategic Deployment]</strong> — Free combination, no &quot;strongest,&quot; only more ingenious!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hundreds of characters to freely mix and match: Build your unique team composition.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Positioning strategy: Frontline defense, backline damage, side flanks—each square on the board is crucial to the outcome!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Formation strategy: Use the limited and suitable positioning zones to arrange your troops and resist strong enemies!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>[Spell Surprises]</strong> — Turn the tide, the outcome is in your fingertips!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cast spells during battle: Group healing, area freezes, deadly critical hits… The precise timing of spell usage determines the course of the battle!</p>",
